993" lry="730" /><zone xml:id="m-4a02346f-dda8-4ed7-8815-4cbb7c9df72b" ulx="122" uly="725" lrx="555" lry="757" /><zone xml:id="m-f6841aa3-323e-4fe9-b4a7-ad483875a4a1" ulx="563" uly="725" lrx="993" lry="764" /><zone xml:id="m-04ba42df-907f-4926-b886-f6a26b20202c" ulx="121" uly="751" lrx="554" lry="783" /><zone xml:id="m-cca86fc9-b601-48e6-aa2b-19ca213210fe" ulx="563" uly="751" lrx="816" lry="787" /><zone xml:id="m-282ac6a0-ded3-4f40-b19a-728b51ffe37e" ulx="122" uly="778" lrx="557" lry="813" /><zone xml:id="m-6329ee6d-1b4d-4390-b66c-bef9300a824b" ulx="435" uly="827" lrx="676" lry="858" /><zone xml:id="m-f47c5084-2148-4e4e-baad-6dd5f85e434d" ulx="164" uly="857" lrx="994" lry="896" /><zone xml:id="m-17e61370-c35a-47c7-bf58-d80d02600105" ulx="128" uly="885" lrx="989" lry="925" /><zone xml:id="m-859040d7-e873-44b0-a542-fb5eb3e59f8b" ulx="127" uly="914" lrx="563" lry="947" /><zone xml:id="m-80efca4e-ea54-4a0d-a501-413b2cb27603" ulx="149" uly="960" lrx="993" lry="1005" /><zone xml:id="m-501cf49d-7e26-4fdf-b260-7ec7c726ceec" ulx="122" uly="990" lrx="405" lry="1029" /></surface></facsimile><body>
    <mdiv type="solesmes">
      <score>
        <section>
          <pb xml:id="m-070a6e14-0d29-4500-8d30-a4dbeffb0024" n="1502" facs="#m-4f8b924b-df48-4716-a2d6-5e85d4917b9f" /><div xml:id="m-28aa3b79-f34c-4903-9abb-e9ec2c216395">
            <lg xml:id="m-09edb1f0-4d27-4664-944d-b515e55dc96f">
              <l xml:id="m-1e5288d0-62af-4bbd-8336-12daab1bf60c" facs="#m-918085b6-4d92-471f-b27d-b392ffd600f7" label="ambiguous">1302</l><l xml:id="m-5eee1636-a75c-444a-9b3d-d7df014f4e40" facs="#m-b8de8e13-6773-4f27-80f7-0fc203933445" label="ambiguous">occasional Prayers.</l><l xml:id="m-b2c5fd0c-4d72-453b-bf5a-b20276a195c8" facs="#m-32d6d4f0-8d7d-4be9-b61d-df060aefe5f4" label="ambiguous">Secret.</l><l xml:id="m-635fe88e-ceb6-4b69-98cf-3bb75cdef073" facs="#m-044bdaaf-112a-4442-bbc8-16f03257c18a" label="lyrics-like">Fférimus tibi, Dómine, laudes cedéndis semper suppliciter depre¬</l><l xml:id="m-487938b7-93c5-4b3d-bdbf-86497041ecea" facs="#m-a9d61626-c7c8-44a1-9b03-127bffd15b01" label="lyrics-like">U et múnera, pro concéssis bene- cántes. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-d2da322e-b968-457a-a370-102c9e65e669" facs="#m-cd9a3a27-2123-440f-8d97-d14cd6fc591d" label="lyrics-like">ficiis grátias referéntes, et pro con¬</l><l xml:id="m-08036695-460d-4a83-a104-fabe67ce6ee8" facs="#m-a3de7715-bade-4d34-bf87-e531ed4d5c67" label="ambiguous">Postcommunion.</l><l xml:id="m-6b7375d1-5f78-4fcd-ad68-9e8b59da05e3" facs="#m-34f8e752-1c21-42cb-9578-0b11957d4290" label="lyrics-like">Mnipotens sempitérne Deus, qui  jus optátae consolatiónis laetémur,</l><l xml:id="m-08f8cac5-1dce-4e06-babf-ed539aeb1060" facs="#m-415d7d65-b41c-4b33-85d7-ec1fde7a2fc8" label="lyrics-like">U nos et castigándo sanas, et igno- et dono tuae pietátis semper utá¬</l><l xml:id="m-bb9e2947-54db-4046-9ece-d86fb7bc9218" facs="#m-332b51f8-f8fa-4f0d-9e9c-404536f13067" label="lyrics-like">scéndo consérvas : praesta supplíci- mur. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-3f2fdde0-9783-44eb-9259-0544ac131201" facs="#m-7ed320cf-6ff6-4326-9f84-a72277effa70" label="lyrics-like">bus tuis; ut et tranquillitátibus hu¬</l><l xml:id="m-584d178c-6230-4e0d-ab9a-90c1651c7b36" facs="#m-5b7cbd08-635d-44c3-80cd-55901744a2ef" label="text-like">For the Welfare of the Living.</l><l xml:id="m-359ac7e0-f9bb-4dce-909d-6332e1b52595" facs="#m-d56fb173-9cc5-4edd-8ca9-b2c6efe7ae07" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-a95f6e11-bcae-4f8f-9a0b-c0bb25988980" facs="#m-26b052ea-368a-476e-ad6c-384476ef73f9" label="lyrics-like">DRaeténde, Dómine, fidélibus tuis! digne póstulant, cónsequi mereán¬</l><l xml:id="m-49e5500c-b76f-4fe9-ae58-28c10a987185" facs="#m-ca82fb93-7de0-4828-bc36-f5f1da7c832b" label="lyrics-like">E déxteram caeléstis auxilii: ut tur. Per Dóminúm nostrum Jesum</l><l xml:id="m-3848ccce-1bb7-445e-958e-041c2fed4b00" facs="#m-7fc8ad14-61bc-4f11-9aee-a41b38a79a20" label="lyrics-like">te toto corde perquírant, et quael Christum.</l><l xml:id="m-20a9552e-bf11-448c-bc54-09edc90f83f4" facs="#m-5b78f911-f61f-4282-bb7c-d49e75e1f980" label="ambiguous">Secret.</l><l xml:id="m-71a5bcae-fe3c-4204-babc-aff8aea44a8f" facs="#m-8af9eb40-404c-4a62-a2d5-8390cb97d266" label="lyrics-like">DRopitiáre, Dómine, supplicatió-] tum votum, nullius vácua postulátio,</l><l xml:id="m-13aabd4a-6f75-4a7b-b962-7c6e74fa9c48" facs="#m-ca4a137a-3584-450d-ae64-d2b053448475" label="lyrics-like">E nibus nostris, et has oblatiónes</l><l xml:id="m-557c25c1-ea9d-45a9-81ca-17cfaa8f2c1e" facs="#m-6f436bbb-ded0-48b4-8298-36d143221875" label="lyrics-like">praesta, quaésumus; ut quod fidé¬</l><l xml:id="m-5a13a0bc-ab9f-4eb0-93e3-2d41d434e4dc" facs="#m-4a02346f-dda8-4ed7-8815-4cbb7c9df72b" label="lyrics-like">nidélium tuórum, quas tibi pro in¬</l><l xml:id="m-d47476a9-b025-44d5-be42-7dbdedc16a19" facs="#m-f6841aa3-323e-4fe9-b4a7-ad483875a4a1" label="lyrics-like">liter pétimus, efficáciter consequá¬</l><l xml:id="m-3a0d5443-53c2-4fab-8ed4-bc65486e169c" facs="#m-04ba42df-907f-4926-b886-f6a26b20202c" label="lyrics-like">columitáte eórum offérimus, bení¬</l><l xml:id="m-dd8f5b64-9aec-4cf7-af7b-7abf915d7963" facs="#m-cca86fc9-b601-48e6-aa2b-19ca213210fe" label="lyrics-like">mur. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-095f1f30-8bcf-449b-a39f-3d6def18c287" facs="#m-282ac6a0-ded3-4f40-b19a-728b51ffe37e" label="lyrics-like">gnus assúme : et, ut nullius sit f́rri¬</l><l xml:id="m-75174623-db5c-4512-b4b5-a7b83243411b" facs="#m-6329ee6d-1b4d-4390-b66c-bef9300a824b" label="ambiguous">Postcommunion.</l><l xml:id="m-d7afcace-c3a8-4647-a3f8-a86864ed2ccf" facs="#m-f47c5084-2148-4e4e-baad-6dd5f85e434d" label="lyrics-like">A fidélibus tuis, quaésumus Dó-] firmáti, nullis tentatiónibus ab ejus</l><l xml:id="m-cb786d95-078f-4a5b-a3af-cce3621a3bc7" facs="#m-17e61370-c35a-47c7-bf58-d80d02600105" label="lyrics-like">U mine, in tua fide et sinceritâte integritáte vellántur. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-9d47ebdf-fdda-4a25-89ea-e9fbc7c930d1" facs="#m-859040d7-e873-44b0-a542-fb5eb3e59f8b" label="lyrics-like">constántiam : ut in caritáte divína</l><l xml:id="m-ff680da6-2b05-4151-b125-00507bf0f1ce" facs="#m-80efca4e-ea54-4a0d-a501-413b2cb27603" label="text-like">For the Living and the Dead. Collect, p. 526. Secret, p. 529.</l><l xml:id="m-cd364d28-4751-4fc7-8297-5d45d9cfc72a" facs="#m-501cf49d-7e26-4fdf-b260-7ec7c726ceec" label="ambiguous">Postcommunion, p. 530.</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
</mei>